=========================================================================
BUILD CHECKLIST (new leather or kilim piece)
=========================================================================
1. productSet (synchronous:true): Size=[One Size], Construction=[Leather|Kilim],
   1 variant, CONTINUE, price. Tags include category + material + 'Made to Order'.
2. metafieldsSet: aav.configurator (Template A or B), aav.swatches (leather IDs to
   expose + 3 hardware IDs), aav.size_dimensions.
3. Upload photos; set alt text per aa-alt-text-convention; publish (ACTIVE) + add
   to relevant collection (tag-based smart collection).
